### Movie Ticket Booking System: runnable requests (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Seed accounts: admin@moviebooking.com / Admin@123 · demo@moviebooking.com / Customer@123
@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@date = 2026-10-01

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Browse (public)
GET {{base}}/cities

###
GET {{base}}/cities/1/movies?date={{date}}&language=English

###
GET {{base}}/movies/1

### Theaters + showtimes for a movie, nearest first
GET {{base}}/movies/1/shows?cityId=1&date={{date}}&lat=12.97&lng=77.59

### Seat map (send again with If-None-Match: <ETag> to get 304)
GET {{base}}/shows/34/seats

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Customer
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "riya@example.com", "password": "Password@123", "fullName": "Riya Sharma" }

###
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Basic demo@moviebooking.com Customer@123

### Price preview with a discount (nothing held)
POST {{base}}/discounts/preview
Authorization: Basic demo@moviebooking.com Customer@123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "FIRST50", "showId": 34, "seatIds": [241, 242] }

### Hold seats (all or nothing)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Basic demo@moviebooking.com Customer@123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": 34, "seatIds": [241, 242], "discountCode": "FIRST50" }

> {% client.global.set("bookingId", response.body.bookingId); %}

### Pay (replay with the same key → same result, no second charge; paymentToken "tok_decline" → 402)
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/pay
Authorization: Basic demo@moviebooking.com Customer@123
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentToken": "tok_visa" }

###
GET {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Basic demo@moviebooking.com Customer@123

### Cancel (refund % from the theater's policy)
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Basic demo@moviebooking.com Customer@123

### Booking history (cursor pagination: pass nextCursor back as ?cursor=)
GET {{base}}/me/bookings?size=5
Authorization: Basic demo@moviebooking.com Customer@123

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Admin
POST {{base}}/admin/cities
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Pune", "state": "Maharashtra" }

###
POST {{base}}/admin/theaters/1/screens
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "IMAX", "rows": [ { "rowLabel": "A", "seatCount": 12, "seatType": "REGULAR" },
                            { "rowLabel": "B", "seatCount": 10, "seatType": "PREMIUM" } ] }

###
POST {{base}}/admin/shows
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "movieId": 2, "screenId": 7, "startTime": "2026-10-05T19:00:00+05:30", "regularPrice": 280.00, "premiumPrice": 450.00, "weekendMultiplier": 1.30 }

### Change a show's prices (only while nobody has booked it)
PUT {{base}}/admin/shows/40
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "regularPrice": 250.00, "premiumPrice": 400.00, "weekendMultiplier": 1.20 }

###
POST {{base}}/admin/discounts
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "DIWALI25", "type": "PERCENT", "value": 25, "maxDiscount": 200, "minOrder": 300,
  "validFrom": "2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30", "validTo": "2026-11-15T00:00:00+05:30",
  "usageLimit": 500, "perUserLimit": 2 }

###
GET {{base}}/admin/refund-policies
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123

### Cancel a show: every booking refunded 100%, safe to re-run
POST {{base}}/admin/shows/40/cancel
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123

###
GET {{base}}/admin/refunds?status=FAILED
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123

###
GET {{base}}/admin/outbox?status=PENDING
Authorization: Basic admin@moviebooking.com Admin@123
